 "note": "Reading Cinemas Busselton (five screens on level one, opened 2023-24) and the glazed stair atrium beside it, at the north-east corner of Busselton Central, facing the plaza off Kent St (and Mitchell Park to the east). A skin over the base's generic box, which already runs round this corner as a curved footprint. From the Landgate aerial (Oct 2026) and a June 2025 photo from the plaza (Cinema Treasures): a tall white rounded upper volume with READING CINEMAS in dark plain capitals and a grey ribbed band on top, a white wave canopy round its foot over timber-clad walls, and a dark glazed box with the stair (the grid roof in the aerial) between it and the Pavilion's alfresco. The curve is drawn as steps; the canopy as flat slabs. Plain lettering only. Metres: x left to right as seen from Kent St (east to west), y south from the box's Kent St wall line.",
